sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Router as Router Agent
    participant Exec as Executive Agent
    participant Memory as Memory Agent
    participant Research as Research Agent
    participant LLM as LLM Provider

    User->>Router: "What did I discuss about AI last week?"
    Router->>Router: Classify intent
    Router->>Exec: Route to Executive
    Exec->>Memory: Search episodic memories
    Memory-->>Exec: Return relevant memories
    Exec->>Research: Enrich with knowledge
    Research->>LLM: Generate response
    LLM-->>Research: Response with context
    Research-->>Exec: Enriched response
    Exec-->>User: "Last week you discussed..."
